  "inspection_notes": [
    "Original PNG files were copied byte for byte; no background removal, recoloring, resizing, cleanup, regeneration or variants.",
    "Both atlases have actual alpha transparency. The preview can appear to show colored backgrounds; pixel inspection confirms extensive alpha=0 areas. The actors atlas has no fully opaque pixels (maximum alpha 254), with the solid character interiors mostly around alpha 250\u2013253. Very faint low-alpha residual pixels reach canvas edges.",
    "All twelve actor poses and all twelve requested icons are present in the requested order. Hero poses face right; rival poses face left. Complete weapons are present. Some weapons and feet cross nominal equal-cell boundaries. Use measured per-sprite bounds, not strict grid slicing.",
    "Actor bounding rectangles can include a few neighboring sprite pixels because adjacent silhouettes share some x/y ranges; foreign_visible_pixels_in_rectangular_crop quantifies this. In particular rival windup and strike crops need shape-aware clipping if using their full measured bounds.",
    "The requested 25 percent icon gutters were not achieved consistently; several icon effects and shapes extend beyond the central 75 percent of the nominal cells. Individual measured bounds are supplied.",
    "Ground baselines and body scales vary slightly across poses; supplied estimated ground pivots allow placement compensation. Death pivots refer to the resting body, excluding low weapon tips.",
    "Arena is an opaque side-view-compatible courtyard with a clear lower fighting floor. Native size 1672x941 is approximately 16:9; it was not resized."
